Bundled libraries
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Python libraries redistributed inside the container image — including
PyTorch, nibabel, einops, omegaconf, safetensors, huggingface_hub, and their
transitive dependency closure — each remain under their own license; the full
license texts travel with each package's distribution.
